{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"【CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026】「Epic Games」「Live2D」「Diarkis」攤位報導！Unreal Engine 5.8的新功能、2D模型製作及即時通訊技術登場\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2abbbeaef660a638a78efcc68ebc7dea881205f9f26f65939d735de73f17d47/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe17ef62c50f3b52207bca2934a7baa1e.jpg_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>【CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026】「Epic Games」「Live2D」「Diarkis」攤位報導！Unreal Engine 5.8的新功能、2D模型製作及即時通訊技術登場</figcaption></figure><p>2026年11月14日(六)於九州產業大學舉辦的遊戲開發者技術交流活動「<strong>CEDEC+KYUSHU 2026</strong>」<br/>此次將報導「<strong>Epic Games Japan株式會社</strong>」「<strong>Live2D</strong>」「<strong>Diarkis</strong>」的攤位！<br/>以「Unreal Engine」為首，支援遊戲開發的各家公司技術目前有著怎樣的進化呢？</p><h2>從運用AI製作遊戲到即時通訊技術！一起看看不斷進化的開發技術</h2><figure><img alt=\"Epic Games Japan株式會社\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ffc0d83f4dfd705bffbd988ea23f359d68350983a8c705d6ae874c586ad0a3a2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2a9088b42fd686f06707128c7c41ec29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Epic Games Japan株式會社攤位</figcaption></figure><p>首先從Epic Games Japan株式會社開始！</p><p></p><figure><img alt=\"Unreal Engine\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4461c9516db7e3885c86c1d5d00e33a0385b4772571c67f213b73abc555f229f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffc1d9cfcaf5b9090e149edf04b6d17e4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Unreal Engine</figcaption></figure><p>攤位上介紹了由Epic Games開發的遊戲引擎「<strong>Unreal Engine</strong>」的最新技術。<br/>馬上來看看展示內容吧。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"MetaHuman Crowd\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f96a2915f08af9331d98a669413de5cc57dcd494a22c4b3f3d8e1cf85f9995fe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F59f7bbede6367f21ef31084d1424c141.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>MetaHuman Crowd</figcaption></figure><p>現場進行了Unreal Engine 5.8的新功能「<strong>MetaHuman Crowd</strong>」的展示。<br/>可根據與攝影機的距離調整人物的解析度，在降低渲染負載的同時呈現數百人規模的人群。</p><figure><img alt=\"以35FPS顯示1,000人\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9d3d643ab58391276c241cf1e73a37af503a20ef3e6977dfe51120d0afae7df9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F98d8c04ef91215efde459e2098f15fa6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>以35FPS顯示1,000人</figcaption></figure><p>展示中以35FPS顯示1,000人。<br/>據悉，攝影機畫面中的375人有4人以高解析度渲染。</p><figure><img alt=\"Unreal MCP\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2f1d54c34980201848fd87fb1d7f051e12e25192388d5c3b84e622f896b4b248/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3b2f0e1b753b3ec9e5168fd03692f177.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Unreal MCP</figcaption></figure><p>旁邊則進行了運用「<strong>Unreal MCP</strong>」製作遊戲的展示。<br/>在畫面右側向AI輸入內容後，Unreal Engine便會自動運作，並將內容反映至遊戲中。</p><h3>讓2D插畫隨心所欲地動起來！一起看看Live2D的製作畫面</h3><figure><img alt=\"Live2D攤位\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b51d45c7780481102c08746b837fe74c0ea21d95ba965c293b641d2248591794/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Facd890035e204b3eb3ae6d6b7d998c55.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Live2D攤位</figcaption></figure><p>接著來看看Live2D攤位吧！</p><figure><img alt=\"可細部調整設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/312ba97da74baac20f354cf046064a6c830af5930e5546765c5c9dd28ac6ccf4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8c2154d0521b7eff180c9dc30458e740.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>可細部調整設定！</figcaption></figure><p>攤位上展示了使用Live2D製作2D模型的畫面。<br/>可以詳細設定臉部等各個部位的動作方式及範圍。</p><figure><img alt=\"宣傳手冊\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1440\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fdfdbbd988b4baafea2484c452ae4da4f66db95472dd7c15dbca3b09adbabdc9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffa5af1ef33dae36b8d3e593b746737ec.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>宣傳手冊</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貼紙\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0977679da6fe17fa8deb2b9661828cdd0791a8424ec478466014bae1da30c606/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fac8871a62214fcac28aa65a5d4952b7c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>貼紙</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"裝飾貼紙\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dc6ec5c62fca21949fcbbc1e0b68d1865604fbcff69bfdd99385f20cac7eeb9b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb7a6f6b44e587c65f3735ee89947336b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>裝飾貼紙</figcaption></figure><p>收到了宣傳手冊、貼紙及裝飾貼紙作為紀念品。</p><h3>支援線上遊戲！Diarkis的即時通訊技術</h3><figure><img alt=\"Diarkis攤位\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f6b479cdf9c6fce58c2652c41b7b708800ae6f8035280a0fe4b783d91061ad1b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd80d2f86ad6e1b766a629d30f99a5561.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Diarkis攤位</figcaption></figure><p>最後來看看Diarkis攤位！</p><figure><img alt=\"採用企業\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/878117c1da3ef8217e819c7a7e385b914a03eb59e7945387e3d96c192e115bb2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3e0d7907c3beefe025647ee1e61eb58f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>應用於各式各樣的遊戲中！</figcaption></figure><p>Diarkis是一家為「<strong>DRAGON BALL GEKISHIN SQUADRA</strong>」等遊戲提供線上遊戲用即時通訊技術的企業。</p><figure><img alt=\"飲用水\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/696ebf95776c0d4422cb244a372a6126c65cb376e5b2fffbd75d62fb33ee0c27/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F39320b1e29062804f3e41c7dc32f716e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>飲用水</figcaption></figure><p>收到了Diarkis原創瓶裝水作為宣傳贈品！</p><p>從運用AI製作遊戲、2D模型的表現方式，到支援線上遊戲的即時通訊等，是一場能夠近距離體驗各家公司技術的展示。<br/>也一起關注Epic Games Japan、Live2D及Diarkis今後的發展吧！</p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/one-piece-fortnitetreasurehunters-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「ONE PIECE × 要塞英雄」真實尋寶活動「東京寶藏獵人」舉辦！頭獎為「Gold Mercedes-AMG G 63」</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/fortnite-kingdom-hearts-collaboration/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《要塞英雄》推出《王國之心》！實裝索拉等角色服裝與「王國之鍵」</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/fortnite-kingdom-hearts-sora-collaboration-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「要塞英雄」將迎來「王國之心」的索拉！預計本週上線</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/onimusha-ws/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《鬼武者 Way of the Sword》終於上市！同步舉辦上市紀念活動，還有機會抽中電競PC</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/ffvii-revelation-release-date/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「FINAL FANTASY VII REVELATION」確定於2027年4月8日發售！也有收錄重製三部曲的划算套組登場</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:23:55.806748+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1296,"images":14,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:57:47.042020+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:17:26.270719+00:00","content_hash":"f7dfa39e2befa3ef12ab82b088c7de9b4dd406be0dea7b299f7200fb481346f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}